{"originalLanguage":"en","title":"Viva La Vida","artist":"Coldplay","date":"2026-10-11","sourceId":"15631910:024","sourceHash":"fe528ed4269c5f503052372f3744f59cd5b1db7e4d91fda37b70908250472841","duration":246.6,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":12.729686999999103,"end":14.681687000000238,"text":"I used to rule the world","translation":"한때 나는 세상을 다스렸지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":14.74168699999791,"end":19.08268699999826,"text":"Seas would rise when I gave the word","translation":"내가 명하면 바다가 솟아올랐어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":19.14268699999957,"end":23.75268700000015,"text":"Now in the morning, I sleep alone","translation":"이제 아침이면 홀로 잠들고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":23.81268700000146,"end":29.81268700000146,"text":"Sweep the streets I used to own","translation":"한때 내 것이던 거리를 쓸어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":38.00168699999995,"end":41.33268699999826,"text":"I used to roll the dice","translation":"한때 나는 주사위를 굴렸지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":41.39268699999957,"end":44.53268699999899,"text":"Feel the fear in my enemy's eyes","translation":"적의 눈에 어린 공포를 느끼며","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":44.592687000000296,"end":49.742686999998114,"text":"Listened as the crowd would sing","translation":"군중이 노래하는 소리를 들었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":49.80268699999942,"end":52.56268700000146,"text":"\"Now the old king is dead, long live the king\"","translation":"옛 왕은 죽었다 새 왕 만세","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":52.62268699999913,"end":56.8436870000005,"text":"One minute I held the key","translation":"한순간 열쇠를 쥐고 있었는데","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":56.90368699999817,"end":59.722687000001315,"text":"Next, the walls were closed on me","translation":"다음 순간 벽이 날 에워쌌어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":59.78268699999899,"end":65.78268699999899,"text":"And I discovered that my castles stand","translation":"그리고 내 성이 서 있다는 걸 알았지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":66.18268700000044,"end":69.74268699999811,"text":"Upon pillars of salt and pillars of sand","translation":"소금 기둥과 모래 기둥 위에","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":69.80268699999942,"end":73.9226869999984,"text":"I hear Jerusalem bells a-ringing","translation":"예루살렘 종소리가 울리는 걸 들어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":73.98268699999971,"end":79.0926870000003,"text":"Roman cavalry choirs are singing","translation":"로마 기병대의 합창이 노래해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":79.15268699999797,"end":82.37268699999913,"text":"Be my mirror, my sword and shield","translation":"나의 거울 나의 칼과 방패가 되어 줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":82.43268700000044,"end":86.38268700000117,"text":"My missionaries in a foreign field","translation":"낯선 땅에 선 나의 선교사들","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":86.44268699999884,"end":89.38268700000117,"text":"For some reason, I can't explain","translation":"무슨 까닭인지 설명할 수 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":89.44268699999884,"end":90.51468699999896,"text":"Once you'd gone, there was never","translation":"네가 떠난 뒤로는 한 번도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":90.57468700000027,"end":92.11268700000073,"text":"Never an honest word","translation":"단 한마디의 진실도 없었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":92.1726869999984,"end":98.1726869999984,"text":"And that was when I ruled the world","translation":"그때는 내가 세상을 다스렸지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":111.53268699999899,"end":115.80668700000024,"text":"It was a wicked and wild wind","translation":"사악하고 거센 바람이었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":115.86668699999791,"end":118.6026869999987,"text":"Blew down the doors to let me in","translation":"문을 무너뜨려 나를 들여보냈지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":118.662687,"end":123.13368700000137,"text":"Shattered windows and the sound of drums","translation":"깨진 창문과 북소리","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":123.19368699999904,"end":126.44968700000027,"text":"People couldn't believe what I'd become","translation":"사람들은 내가 변한 모습을 믿지 못했어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":126.50968699999794,"end":130.44068699999843,"text":"Revolutionaries wait","translation":"혁명가들은 기다려","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":130.50068699999974,"end":132.98668700000053,"text":"For my head on a silver plate","translation":"은쟁반 위에 놓일 내 머리를","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":133.0466869999982,"end":137.73668700000053,"text":"Just a puppet on a lonely string","translation":"외로운 줄에 매달린 꼭두각시","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":137.7966869999982,"end":141.65468699999838,"text":"Oh, who would ever want to be king?","translation":"누가 왕이 되길 바라겠어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":141.71468699999969,"end":145.39568700000018,"text":"I hear Jerusalem bells a-ringing","translation":"예루살렘 종소리가 울리는 걸 들어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":145.4556870000015,"end":148.93968699999823,"text":"Roman cavalry choirs are singing","translation":"로마 기병대의 합창이 노래해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":148.99968699999954,"end":152.5356869999996,"text":"Be my mirror, my sword and shield","translation":"나의 거울 나의 칼과 방패가 되어 줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":152.5956870000009,"end":156.15268699999797,"text":"My missionaries in a foreign field","translation":"낯선 땅에 선 나의 선교사들","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":156.21268699999928,"end":159.87368699999934,"text":"For some reason, I can't explain","translation":"무슨 까닭인지 설명할 수 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":159.93368700000065,"end":163.18868699999803,"text":"I know Saint Peter won't call my name","translation":"성 베드로는 내 이름을 부르지 않겠지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":163.24868699999934,"end":166.37968700000056,"text":"Never an honest word","translation":"단 한마디의 진실도 없었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":166.43968699999823,"end":172.43968699999823,"text":"But that was when I ruled the world","translation":"하지만 그때는 내가 세상을 다스렸지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":200.05068699999902,"end":203.1606869999996,"text":"Hear Jerusalem bells a-ringing","translation":"예루살렘 종소리가 울리는 걸 들어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":203.2206870000009,"end":206.88168700000097,"text":"Roman cavalry choirs are singing","translation":"로마 기병대의 합창이 노래해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":206.94168699999864,"end":210.29068700000062,"text":"Be my mirror, my sword and shield","translation":"나의 거울 나의 칼과 방패가 되어 줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":210.3506869999983,"end":214.05268699999942,"text":"My missionaries in a foreign field","translation":"낯선 땅에 선 나의 선교사들","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":214.11268700000073,"end":217.6486870000008,"text":"For some reason, I can't explain","translation":"무슨 까닭인지 설명할 수 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":217.70868699999846,"end":220.912687,"text":"I know Saint Peter won't call my name","translation":"성 베드로는 내 이름을 부르지 않겠지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":220.97268700000132,"end":224.27968699999838,"text":"Never an honest word","translation":"단 한마디의 진실도 없었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":224.33968699999969,"end":230.33968699999969,"text":"But that was when I ruled the world","translation":"하지만 그때는 내가 세상을 다스렸지","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}